WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.648
Aw! You're cute!

2
00:00:11.649 --> 00:00:16.003
Who are you?

3
00:00:16.004 --> 00:00:19.689
I'm a ladybug.

4
00:00:19.690 --> 00:00:23.117
We're small beetles.

5
00:00:23.118 --> 00:00:27.099
Beetles are insects.

6
00:00:27.100 --> 00:00:30.932
Where do you live?

7
00:00:30.933 --> 00:00:37.202
Ladybugs live all over the world.

8
00:00:37.203 --> 00:00:42.965
We like forests, rivers, and even houses.

9
00:00:42.966 --> 00:00:49.608
Some people call us "ladybirds" or "lady beetles."

10
00:00:49.609 --> 00:00:52.925
What do you eat?

11
00:00:52.926 --> 00:00:56.933
We like bugs that eat plants.

12
00:00:56.934 --> 00:01:02.450
So farmers love ladybugs.

13
00:01:02.451 --> 00:01:06.390
We protect their crops!

14
00:01:06.391 --> 00:01:12.142
You're bright red!

15
00:01:12.143 --> 00:01:19.335
Ladybugs are usually red, yellow, or orange.

16
00:01:19.336 --> 00:01:22.898
Some ladybugs have stripes.

17
00:01:22.899 --> 00:01:28.100
But most have black spots like mine.

18
00:01:28.101 --> 00:01:31.787
Why do you have those spots?

19
00:01:31.788 --> 00:01:36.928
Our spots and bright colors keep enemies away.

20
00:01:36.929 --> 00:01:42.579
They warn animals that we taste bad!

21
00:01:42.580 --> 00:01:46.527
Who are your enemies?

22
00:01:46.528 --> 00:01:50.498
Birds sometimes eat ladybugs.

23
00:01:50.499 --> 00:01:56.168
So do frogs, spiders, and dragonflies.

24
00:01:56.169 --> 00:01:59.440
Do you sleep during winter?

25
00:01:59.441 --> 00:02:07.035
Yes. We sleep under rocks or inside old logs.

26
00:02:07.036 --> 00:02:14.536
Sometimes we go into houses to get warm.

27
00:02:14.537 --> 00:02:19.671
Did you see my wings?

28
00:02:19.672 --> 00:02:25.772
Look! I can fly!

29
00:02:25.773 --> 00:02:33.210
Bye, Ladybug!

